@DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7249

### Public practice website content
GET {{DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/site
Accept: application/json

### Public published pages
GET {{DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/pages
Accept: application/json

### Request an appointment (this submits a request, not a confirmed booking)
POST {{DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Taylor Example",
  "email": "taylor@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+27123456789",
  "requestedAt": "2027-01-15T10:00:00+02:00"
}

### Sign in as the configured practice administrator
POST {{DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ReplaceWithYourAdminPassword!"
}

### Create a published page (replace token)
POST {{DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/pages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "About the Practice",
  "slug": "about",
  "summary": "Learn about our practice.",
  "body": "Public website content.",
  "isPublished": true
}

### List appointment requests (replace token)
GET {{DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirm an appointment request (replace token and ID)
PATCH {{DoctorPracticeCmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}
